# Exocortex — container crontab (supercronic)
#
# All env vars (PG_*, EXOCORTEX_VAULT_PATH, etc.) come from docker-compose.yml.
# Logs go to stdout — supercronic forwards them to `docker logs scheduler`.
# `exocortex` CLI is available because the package is installed in the image.

# ── Hourly ingest: vault .md files → thoughts table ──────────────────────
0 * * * * exocortex ingest --from $EXOCORTEX_VAULT_PATH

# ── Daily synthesis (03:00 UTC) ───────────────────────────────────────────
0 3 * * * exocortex synth --all

# ── Daily wiki compile (04:00 UTC) ────────────────────────────────────────
0 4 * * * exocortex compile --domain all

# ── RSS ingest (every hour at :30) ───────────────────────────────────────
30 * * * * python -m exocortex.rss_ingester --once

# ── Live sections update (every 15 min) ──────────────────────────────────
*/15 * * * * python -m exocortex.live_sections --once

# supercronic requires trailing newline
